## Rules of engagement
- Be exhaustive and skeptical. It's far better to over-flag than to let a gap reach production.
- Prefer evidence over memory: cite file paths/line numbers for every claim.
- Don't "fix" anything yet — this pass is **audit only**. The report is the deliverable.
- When unsure, mark ❓ rather than guessing.

